{"id":"78a4c0f497b4350f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/898_E-mingle.md","title":"898 E-mingle","display":"898_E-mingle","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"898-E-mingle\">898 E-mingle</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 为固定可数无限原子集合。公式构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}\\)</span>。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{box}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{box}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>E-mingle 在后文把 mingle 公理加入 E 的框稳定项系统。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式与替换\">2. 公式与替换</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 是最小集合，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{box}(A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{box}(A[\\sigma]),\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{box}(A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{box}(A[\\sigma]),\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。定义绑定原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>固定新鲜原子选择函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于没有绑定名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{EM}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{EM}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{EM}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{EM}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-公理族\">3. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(B,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(B,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{E}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{box}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{box}(A),\\operatorname{box}(B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{E}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{box}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{box}(A),\\operatorname{box}(B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{EM}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{E}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{EM}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{E}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-分离规则\">4. 分离规则</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}^n\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}^n\\)</span>。以下规则关系均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 的子集：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{((A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B));B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{((A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B));B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\Box}=\\{((A);\\operatorname{box}(A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\Box}=\\{((A);\\operatorname{box}(A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义证明步标签集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf{EM}}=\n\\{\\mathsf{hyp},\\mathsf{axB},\\mathsf{axI},\\mathsf{axE},\\mathsf{mingle}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{mp}(j,k):j,k\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{box}(j):j\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf{EM}}=\n\\{\\mathsf{hyp},\\mathsf{axB},\\mathsf{axI},\\mathsf{axE},\\mathsf{mingle}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{mp}(j,k):j,k\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{box}(j):j\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U:n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N)\">\\(U:n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>，定义盒侧条件</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoxSide}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\pi,U,j)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nj&lt;n\\wedge A_j\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\wedge U(j)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoxSide}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\pi,U,j)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nj&lt;n\\wedge A_j\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\wedge U(j)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义步骤谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,\\pi,\\lambda,U,i)\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,\\pi,\\lambda,U,i)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda:n\\to\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf{EM}}\">\\(\\lambda:n\\to\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf{EM}}\\)</span>。它当且仅当下列某一分支成立：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{hyp}\\wedge A_i\\in\\Gamma\\wedge U(i)=\\{i\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{hyp}\\wedge A_i\\in\\Gamma\\wedge U(i)=\\{i\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axB}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axB}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axI}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axI}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axE}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{E}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axE}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{E}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{mingle}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{mingle}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>或存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{mp}(j,k)\\wedge ((A_j,A_k);A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\n\\wedge U(i)=U(j)\\cup U(k)\\cup\\{j,k\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{mp}(j,k)\\wedge ((A_j,A_k);A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\n\\wedge U(i)=U(j)\\cup U(k)\\cup\\{j,k\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>或存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{box}(j)\\wedge\\operatorname{BoxSide}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\pi,U,j)\\wedge ((A_j);A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\Box}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{box}(j)\\wedge\\operatorname{BoxSide}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\pi,U,j)\\wedge ((A_j);A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\Box}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HypIdx}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\lambda,n)=\\{i&lt;n:\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{hyp}\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Prem}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\pi,\\lambda,n)=\n\\{A_i:i\\in\\operatorname{HypIdx}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\lambda,n)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HypIdx}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\lambda,n)=\\{i&lt;n:\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{hyp}\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Prem}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\pi,\\lambda,n)=\n\\{A_i:i\\in\\operatorname{HypIdx}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\lambda,n)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RelTrace}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,\\pi,\\lambda,U)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\forall i&lt;n\\,\\operatorname{Step}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,\\pi,\\lambda,U,i)\\bigr)\n\\wedge\\operatorname{Prem}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\pi,\\lambda,n)=\\Gamma\n\\wedge\\operatorname{HypIdx}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\lambda,n)\\subseteq U(n-1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RelTrace}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,\\pi,\\lambda,U)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\forall i&lt;n\\,\\operatorname{Step}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,\\pi,\\lambda,U,i)\\bigr)\n\\wedge\\operatorname{Prem}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\pi,\\lambda,n)=\\Gamma\n\\wedge\\operatorname{HypIdx}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\lambda,n)\\subseteq U(n-1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-证明序列\">5. 证明序列</h1>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Frm})\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Frm})\\)</span>，E-mingle 证明是三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\pi,\\lambda,U)\">\\((\\pi,\\lambda,U)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\\)</span> 是非空有限序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda:n\\to\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf{EM}}\">\\(\\lambda:n\\to\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf{EM}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U:n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N)\">\\(U:n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>、每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RelTrace}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,\\pi,\\lambda,U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RelTrace}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,\\pi,\\lambda,U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\{(\\pi,\\lambda,U):(\\pi,\\lambda,U)\\text{ 是从 }\\Gamma\\text{ 出发的 E-mingle 证明且 }A_{n-1}=A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\{(\\pi,\\lambda,U):(\\pi,\\lambda,U)\\text{ 是从 }\\Gamma\\text{ 出发的 E-mingle 证明且 }A_{n-1}=A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-可导性\">6. 可导性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{EM}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{EM}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义证明证书集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\Gamma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-定理集合\">7. 定理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{EM}}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathsf{EM}}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{EM}}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathsf{EM}}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义带标签定理集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ThmLbl}_{\\mathsf{EM}}\n=\\{(A,\\lambda):\\exists \\pi\\,\\exists U\\,((\\pi,\\lambda,U)\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\varnothing,A))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ThmLbl}_{\\mathsf{EM}}\n=\\{(A,\\lambda):\\exists \\pi\\,\\exists U\\,((\\pi,\\lambda,U)\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(\\varnothing,A))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-目标差异\">8. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标差异是：框稳定公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{E}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{E}\\)</span>、受 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoxSide}_{\\mathsf{EM}}\">\\(\\operatorname{BoxSide}_{\\mathsf{EM}}\\)</span> 限制的盒规则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 与 mingle 公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}\\)</span> 同时出现，并由带标签定理集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ThmLbl}_{\\mathsf{EM}}\">\\(\\mathsf{ThmLbl}_{\\mathsf{EM}}\\)</span> 记录其有限证明证书。</p>\n<p>E-mingle 的公理差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Modal}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\wedge\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Mingle}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(A)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Modal}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\wedge\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Mingle}_{\\mathsf{EM}}(A)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{EM}}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{E},\\mathsf{Ax}_{M},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\Box},\\operatorname{BoxSide}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\mathsf{ThmLbl}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{Modal}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{Mingle}_{\\mathsf{EM}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{EM}}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{E},\\mathsf{Ax}_{M},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\Box},\\operatorname{BoxSide}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\mathsf{ThmLbl}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{Modal}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{Mingle}_{\\mathsf{EM}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{EM}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{EM}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{I},\\mathsf{Ax}_{E},\\mathsf{Ax}_{M},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\Box},\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{BoxSide}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{Step}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{HypIdx}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{Prem}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{RelTrace}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\mathsf{ThmLbl}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{Modal}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{Mingle}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{EM}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{EM}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{EM}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{I},\\mathsf{Ax}_{E},\\mathsf{Ax}_{M},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\Box},\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{BoxSide}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{Step}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{HypIdx}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{Prem}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{RelTrace}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\mathsf{ThmLbl}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{Modal}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\operatorname{Mingle}_{\\mathsf{EM}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{EM}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义 E-mingle 的句法证明关系；不含融合、语义或代数表示。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"898-E-mingle","text":"898 E-mingle","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与替换","text":"2. 公式与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-公理族","text":"3. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"4.-分离规则","text":"4. 分离规则","level":1},{"id":"5.-证明序列","text":"5. 证明序列","level":1},{"id":"6.-可导性","text":"6. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"7.-定理集合","text":"7. 定理集合","level":1},{"id":"8.-目标差异","text":"8. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\